 "lyrics": "[Intro - Voicemail, Soft Female Voice]\n[00:01.14]I saw your name light up again\n[00:02.76]same time, same storm\n[00:08.06]and I almost answered like always\n[00:12.24]but I can’t keep being the place you go\n[00:16.84]when you wanna fall apart\n\n[Instrumental Intro]\n[00:19.96]Rain on glass\n[00:24.84]guitar comes in slow\n[00:27.80]808 heart under the floor\n\n[Chorus - Female Lead]\n[00:33.02]I won’t be your fire\n[00:35.66]just because you miss the burn\n[00:38.90]I won’t say the sharp words\n[00:41.66]just to make the silence hurt\n[00:44.24]I know you want the thunder\n[00:46.52]when the quiet gets too loud\n[00:49.22]but I won’t be your reason\n[00:52.76]to keep breaking down\n\n[Post-Chorus - Layered Vocals]\n[00:54.92]No, no, no\n[00:59.00]I won’t be your fire\n[01:01.30]No, no, no\n[01:04.44]I still care, but I’m tired\n\n[Verse 1 - Female Lead, Melodic]\n[01:06.72]You call me when the room gets cold\n[01:08.30]when the posters on your wall\n[01:09.90]start looking like ghosts\n[01:11.50]You say you need a reason\n[01:12.76]just to feel something real\n[01:14.18]but every time I answer\n[01:15.56]I become what you can’t heal\n\n[01:16.98]I know the hallway lights\n[01:18.24]I know the bathroom floor\n[01:19.78]I know the kind of love\n[01:21.02]that turns into a war\n[01:22.74]I know you think the hurt\n[01:23.88]means somebody stayed\n[01:25.36]but pain is not proof\n[01:26.70]that love was ever safe\n\n[Pre-Chorus - Female Lead]\n[01:28.18]I used to throw the match\n[01:29.52]then cry about the smoke\n[01:30.96]I used to say the things\n[01:32.28]that cut into your throat\n[01:33.66]But tonight I’m holding back\n[01:35.08]with both hands on the wire\n[01:36.62]If I love you at all\n[01:38.00]I can’t be your fire\n\n[Chorus - Female Lead, Bigger]\n[01:39.64]I won’t be your fire\n[01:42.94]just because you miss the burn\n[01:45.84]I won’t say the sharp words\n[01:48.60]just to make the silence hurt\n[01:51.14]I know you want the thunder\n[01:53.44]when the quiet gets too loud\n[01:56.12]but I won’t be your reason\n[01:59.64]to keep breaking down\n\n[Post-Chorus - Male Ghost Vocal Behind Her]\n[02:01.56]Don’t leave me alone\n[02:04.02]Don’t leave me alone\n[02:06.86]Don’t leave me alone\n[02:09.94]with my head like this\n\n[Verse 2 - Male Ghost Vocal, Fragile Melodic Rap]\n[02:12.78]I keep your name in my phone\n[02:14.76]like a bruise I can press\n[02:16.14]black hoodie, dead screen\n[02:17.52]bad dreams in my chest\n[02:18.98]I don’t want peace\n[02:20.38]I don’t know what that means\n[02:21.76]I only feel close\n[02:23.12]when you’re angry at me\n\n[02:24.46]I been chasing the crash\n[02:25.90]cause the calm feels fake\n[02:27.34]I been calling it love\n[02:28.70]when it’s only escape\n[02:30.20]Say something cold\n[02:31.44]make it sound like you care\n[02:32.88]I can’t stand the dark\n[02:34.28]when there’s nobody there\n\n[Female Reply - Spoken-Sung]\n[02:35.84]I hear you\n[02:38.06]I do\n[02:38.86]but I won’t hurt you\n[02:42.76]just to prove I’m still here\n\n[Bridge - Duet, Slow Build]\n[Male]\n[02:47.94]What am I supposed to do\n[02:49.48]when the night comes back?\n\n[Female]\n[02:51.56]Breathe till the morning\n[02:53.34]don’t run to the match\n\n[Male]\n[02:56.08]What if I disappear\n[02:58.72]when the signal dies?\n\n[Female]\n[03:02.00]Then I’ll leave one light on\n[03:04.38]but I won’t feed the fire\n\n[Male]\n[03:07.28]Say you hate me\n\n[Female]\n[03:08.50]No\n\n[Male]\n[03:08.90]Say you’re done\n\n[Female]\n[03:09.88]No\n\n[Male]\n[03:10.30]Say anything\n\n[Female]\n[03:11.46]I’m saying no because I love you enough\n[03:14.92]not to become another wound\n\n[Breakdown - Half-Time, Big Guitars]\n[03:18.84]I can miss you\n[03:21.64]and still not answer\n[03:23.22]I can love you\n[03:24.56]and leave the room\n[03:26.62]I can pray that you find daylight\n[03:30.24]without becoming your moon\n\n[03:33.86]I can hold all the good parts\n[03:35.76]and still bury the blade\n[03:38.72]I can remember your soft voice\n[03:41.76]without entering the cage\n[03:44.54]I can cry for the old us\n[03:47.28]without pulling you through\n[03:49.58]another night where the worst thing\n[03:52.74]I say becomes true\n\n[Final Chorus - Full Band, Both Voices]\n[03:55.56]I won’t be your fire\n[03:58.82]just because you miss the burn\n[04:01.72]I won’t say the sharp words\n[04:04.44]just to make the silence hurt\n[04:06.92]I know you want the thunder\n[04:09.22]when the quiet gets too loud\n[04:11.84]but I won’t be your reason\n[04:15.40]to keep breaking down\n\n[Final Chorus Variation - Female Lead]\n[04:17.24]I won’t be your fire\n[04:20.44]I won’t be your knife\n[04:23.14]I won’t be the dark thing\n[04:26.12]that helps you hate your life\n[04:28.54]I’ll leave a little light on\n[04:31.30]but I’m walking out now\n[04:33.90]I won’t be your reason\n[04:37.42]to keep breaking down\n\n[Outro - Voicemail Texture]\n[04:39.38]I hope you get through tonight\n[04:41.02]I hope you don’t need pain\n[04:44.58]to know somebody loved you\n[04:47.84]I hope one day\n[04:50.38]quiet feels safe\n\n[Last Whisper]\n[04:56.93]I won’t be your fire\n[04:59.15]but I’ll leave you the light",
